# Local Pi, agent, and Wiki runtime state belongs to the shared tooling repository,
# never to the trading engine repository. The reviewed project role definitions
# and project-scoped settings below are the sole exceptions: Pi discovers roles
# from .pi/agents/ at startup and loads settings from .pi/settings.json.
/.llm-wiki/
/.pi/*
!/.pi/settings.json
!/.pi/agents/
/.pi/agents/*
!/.pi/agents/*.md
/.pi-subagents/
/artifacts/tool-output/
/evidence/
